  "title": "Zesty Black &amp; Blue Burger",
  "description": "Blue cheese meets burger in this flavorful recipe. Blackening seasoning adds wonderful spice to the patties before they get grilled to perfection.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
  "date_published": "2017-01-19T01:58:14-05:00",
